<title>USA: Japan been slow to deregulate its economy -- Clinton.</title>
<headline>Japan been slow to deregulate its economy -- Clinton.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Clinton said on Sunday that Japan has been slow to deregulate its economy, but noted that Japanese Prime Minister Ryutaro Hashimoto has put foward an ambitious program to do just that.</p>
<p>Clinton made the comment at a news conference after the close of the summit of industrial nations here.</p>
</text>
